<article  class="article" lang="en">
      
<h1 class="page-title">
  Cost Reports and Guidance for Air Pollution Regulations
</h1>
  

      <div class="u-hide-for-print js-toggle-admin-content">
                  <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class="hidden"></div>

  

            </div>
  
        
            
<div>
      <div>
      





  
  

  
  

  
            
  

  <p><strong>On this page:</strong></p><ul><li><a href="#cost%20manual">EPA Air Pollution Control Cost Manual</a></li><li><a href="#cost%20reports">Cost Reports</a></li></ul><hr><h2><a class="ck-anchor" id="cost manual"></a>EPA Air Pollution Control Cost Manual</h2><p>EPA's Control Cost Manual provides guidance for the development of accurate and consistent costs for air pollution control devices. The Control Cost Manual focuses on point source and stationary area source air pollution controls for volatile organic compounds (VOCs), particulate matter (PM), oxides of nitrogen (NOx), and some acid gases (primarily SO2 and HCl).</p><p>EPA is currently updating the Control Cost Manual. This update will be the Seventh Edition and is required under the authority of the 2014 Consolidated Appropriations Act. Below is a listing of EPA's Cost Manual chapters as well as other files related to the Cost Manual. The files are in PDF format unless noted otherwise&nbsp;and can be downloaded by clicking on the links below.</p><h3>Updated Chapters and Related Documents</h3><p>Status and Updated Chapters for the Seventh Edition:</p><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th>Section 1 – Introduction</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Chapter 1 - Background (update expected at completion of Seventh Edition)</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2017-12/documents/epaccmcostestimationmethodchapter_7thedition_2017.pdf">Chapter 2 - Cost Estimation: Concepts and Methodology (Note: This is the final version of this chapter, replacing a draft version on 2/1/2018.) (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(45 pp, 908 KB)</span></td></tr></tbody></table><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th>Section 2&nbsp;– Generic Equipment and Devices</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Chapter 1 - Hoods, Ductwork, and Stacks (expected completion 2029)</td></tr><tr><td>Chapter 2 - Fans, Pumps, and Motors (expected completion 2029)</td></tr><tr><td>Chapter 3 - Permanent Total Enclosures (expected completion 2028)</td></tr><tr><td>Chapter 4 - Monitors (expected completion 2029)</td></tr></tbody></table><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th>Section 3 – VOC Controls; Section 3.1 – VOC Recapture Controls</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2018-10/documents/final_carbonadsorberschapter_7thedition.pdf">Chapter 1 - Carbon Adsorbers, 10/2018 (pdf)</a><span class="fileinfo">&nbsp;(51 pp, 1 MB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li>
  
            



<a href="https://www.epa.gov/sites/default/files/2020-11/epa_carbon_adsorber_calc_sheet_7thedition_nov2020.xlsm" class="file">
<svg class="icon file__icon is-spaced-after" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/themes/epa_theme/images/sprite.artifact.svg#file" /></svg>Carbon Adsorbers Calculation Spreadsheet (note: updated on 11/12/2020) (xlsm)</a>

      
</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-11/documents/erratasheet_carbonadsorbers_costcalcspreadsheet.pdf">Carbon Adsorbers Calculation Spreadsheet – Errata Sheet (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(1 pp, 87 KB)</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li><a href="/sites/production/files/2018-10/documents/rtc_carbonadsorbers_7thedition.pdf">Carbon Adsorbers Response to Comment Document (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(31 pp, 828 KB)</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2017-12/documents/refrigeratedcondenserschapter_7thedition_final.pdf">Chapter 2 - Refrigerated Condensers, 11/2017 (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(44 pp, 736 KB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li>




