  <span class="document__meta">(65.04 KB)

    </span></span>
</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li><a href="/sites/production/files/2017-12/documents/rtc_refrigeratedcondensers_2017final.pdf">Refrigerated Condenser Response to Comment Document (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(32 pp, 583 KB)</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Section 3 – VOC Controls; Section 3.2 – VOC Destruction Controls</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2019-08/documents/flarescostmanualchapter7thedition_august2019vff.pdf">Chapter 1 - Flares, 8/2019 (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(71 pp, 863 KB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li>
  
            



<a href="https://www.epa.gov/system/files/other-files/2022-09/EPA_Flares_CostCalc_Sheet_September%202022.xlsm" class="file">
<svg class="icon file__icon is-spaced-after" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/themes/epa_theme/images/sprite.artifact.svg#file" /></svg>Flares Calculation Spreadsheet (note: updated September 2022) (xlsm)</a>

      
</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li>




<span class="document">
      
            



