<svg class="icon file__icon is-spaced-after" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/themes/epa_theme/images/sprite.artifact.svg#file" /></svg>Errata Sheet - Corrections to Flares Cost Calculation Spreadsheet (pdf)</a>

      
  
  <span class="document__meta">(58.16 KB)

    </span></span>
</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li><a href="/sites/production/files/2019-08/documents/flares_rtcdocument_august2019vff.pdf">Flares Response to Comment Document (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(17 pp, 217 KB)</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><a href="/sites/default/files/2017-12/documents/oxidizersincinerators_chapter2_7theditionfinal.pdf">Chapter 2 - Incinerators and Oxidizers (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(70 pp, 1.2 MB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li>
  
            



<a href="https://www.epa.gov/system/files/other-files/2024-12/us-epa_oaqps_incineratorsoxidizers_calc_sheet_december_2024v.xlsm" class="file">
