<svg class="icon file__icon is-spaced-after" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/themes/epa_theme/images/sprite.artifact.svg#file" /></svg>Errata Sheet - Corrections to Incinerators/Oxidizers Cost Calculation Spreadsheet  (pdf)</a>

      
  
  <span class="document__meta">(116.42 KB)

    </span></span>
</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li><a href="/sites/production/files/2017-12/documents/rtc_-incineratorsoxidizers_2017final.pdf">Incinerators and Oxidizers Response to Comment Document (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(32 pp, 993 KB)</span></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th>Section 4 - NOx Controls</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2017-12/documents/sncrcostmanualchapter7thedition20162017revisions.pdf">Chapter 1 - Selective Non-Catalytic Reduction (Note: updated on 4/25/2019) (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(71 pp, 963 KB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li><a href="/sites/production/files/2021-03/documents/revisions_to_controlcostmanual_sncr_cost_calculation_spreadsheet_march_2021.pdf">SNCR Cost Calculation Spreadsheet – Errata Sheet (pdf)</a>&nbsp;(Note: updated on 3/19/2021)&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(1 pp, 126 KB)</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li>
  
            



<a href="https://www.epa.gov/sites/default/files/2021-03/sncrcontrolcostmanual_costcalculationspreadsheetvf_march_2021.xlsm" class="file">
<svg class="icon file__icon is-spaced-after" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/themes/epa_theme/images/sprite.artifact.svg#file" /></svg>Air Pollution Control Cost Estimation Spreadsheet For Selective Non-Catalytic Reduction (SNCR) (note: updated on 3/19/2021) (xlsm)</a>

      
</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/sncr_costmanual_7thed_rtc.pdf">SNCR Response to Comments Document (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(60 pp, 953 KB)</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2017-12/documents/scrcostmanualchapter7thedition_2016revisions2017.pdf">Chapter 2 - Selective Catalytic Reductio (Note: updated on 06/12/2019) (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(107 pp, 1.3 MB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li>
  
            



<a href="https://www.epa.gov/sites/default/files/2019-06/scrcostmanualspreadsheet_june-2019vf.xlsm" class="file">
<svg class="icon file__icon is-spaced-after" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/themes/epa_theme/images/sprite.artifact.svg#file" /></svg>SCR Cost Calculation Spreadsheet (xlsm)</a>

      
</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/scr_costmanual_7thed_rtc.pdf">SCR Response to Comments Document (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(2 MB)</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Chapter 3 - Low NOx Burners/Ultra-low NOx Burners (expected completion 2026)</td></tr></tbody></table><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th>Section 5 - SO2 and Acid Gas Controls</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2021-05/documents/wet_and_dry_scrubbers_section_5_chapter_1_control_cost_manual_7th_edition.pdf">Chapter 1 - Wet and Dry Scrubbers for Acid Gas Control (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(122 pp, 1.2 MB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li>
  
            



<a href="https://www.epa.gov/system/files/other-files/2023-01/wetanddryscrubbers_controlcostmanualspreadsheet_January%202023.xlsm" class="file">
<svg class="icon file__icon is-spaced-after" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/themes/epa_theme/images/sprite.artifact.svg#file" /></svg>Wet and Dry Scrubbers for Acid Gas Control Cost Calculation Spreadsheet (note: updated on 01/26/2023) (xlsm)</a>

      
</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li><a href="/system/files/documents/2023-01/Errata_Sheet_US_EPA_cost_calculation_spreadsheet_WetandDryScrubbers_January_2023.pdf">Wet and Dry Scrubbers for Acid Gas Control Cost Calculation Spreadsheet - Errata Sheet (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(1 pp, 104 KB)</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><ul><li><a href="/sites/production/files/2021-05/documents/rtcdocument_wet_and_dry_scrubbers_controlcostmanual_7thedition.pdf">Wet and Dry Scrubbers for Acid Gas Control Response to Comment Document (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(39 pp, 507 KB)</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td>Chapter 2 - Dry Sorbent Injection (expected completion 2025)</td></tr></tbody></table><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th>Section 6 – Particulate Matter Controls</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://www.regulations.gov/document/EPA-HQ-OAR-2015-0341-0092">DRAFT - Chapter 1 – Fabric Filters (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(125 pp, 2.6 MB)&nbsp;</span>(Note: The draft file can be downloaded at this link.)</td></tr><tr><td>Chapter 2 - Wet Scrubbers for Particulate Matter (expected completion 2028)</td></tr><tr><td>Chapter 3 - Electrostatic Precipitators (expected completion 2026)</td></tr></tbody></table><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th>Section 7&nbsp;– Mercury&nbsp;Controls</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Chapter 1 - Activated Carbon Injection (expected completion 2027)</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Previous Version of the Cost Manual</h3><p>The previous version of the Control Cost Manual is the Sixth Edition, January 2002:</p><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th>EPA Air Pollution Control Cost Manual - Sixth Edition (EPA 452/B-02-001)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/c_readme.pdf">Read Me File (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(4 pp, 26 KB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/cost_toc.pdf">Table of Contents (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(4 pp, 31 KB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/c_allchs.pdf">Entire Document (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(752 pp, 6 MB)</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Individual chapters of the Control Cost Manual Sixth Edition are listed below:</p><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th>Section 1 - Introduction</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/cs1ch1.pdf">Chapter 1 - Background (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(11 pp, 49 KB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/cs1ch2.pdf">Chapter 2 - Cost Estimation: Concepts and Methodology (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(46 pp, 310 KB)</span></td></tr></tbody></table><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th>Section 2 - Generic Equipment and Devices</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/cs2ch1.pdf">Chapter 1 - Hoods, Ductwork, and Stacks (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(59 pp, 467 KB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/cs2ch3.pdf">Chapter 3 - Permanent Total Enclosures (PTEs) (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(37 pp, 273 KB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/cs2ch4.pdf">Chapter 4 - Monitors (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(41 pp, 313 KB)</span></td></tr></tbody></table><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th>Section 3 - VOC Controls; Section 3.1 - VOC Recapture Controls</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/cs3-1ch1.pdf">Chapter 1 - Carbon Adsorber, 9/1999 (pdf)</a><span class="fileinfo">&nbsp;(4 pp, 671 KB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/cs3-1ch2.pdf">Chapter 2 - Refrigerated Condensers (pdf)</a>&nbsp;(4 pp, 336 KB) 12/1995</td></tr></tbody></table><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th>Section 3 - VOC Controls; Section 3.2 - VOC Destruction Controls</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/cs3-2ch1.pdf">Chapter 1 - Flares (pdf)</a><span class="fileinfo">&nbsp;(46 pp, 281 KB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/cs3-2ch2.pdf">Chapter 2 - Incinerators (pdf)</a><span class="fileinfo">&nbsp;(64 pp, 358 KB)</span></td></tr></tbody></table><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th>Section 4 - NOx Controls; Section 4.2 - NOx Post-Control</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/cs4-2ch1.pdf">Chapter 1 - Selective Non-Catalytic Reduction (pdf)</a><span class="fileinfo">&nbsp;(51 pp, 350 KB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/cs4-2ch2.pdf">Chapter 2 - Selective Catalytic Reduction (pdf)</a><span class="fileinfo">&nbsp;(66 pp, 457 KB)</span></td></tr></tbody></table><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th>Section 5 - SO2 and Acid Gas Controls; Section 5.2 - Post-Combustion Controls</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/cs5-2ch1.pdf">Chapter 1 - Wet Scrubbers for Acid Gas (pdf)</a><span class="fileinfo">&nbsp;(6 pp, 604 KB)</span></td></tr></tbody></table><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th><span>Section 6 - Particulate Matter Controls</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/cs6ch1.pdf">Chapter 1 - Baghouses and Filters (pdf)</a><span class="fileinfo">&nbsp;(60 pp, 475 KB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/cs6ch2.pdf">Chapter 2 - Wet Scrubbers for Particulate Matter (pdf)</a><span class="fileinfo">&nbsp;(62 pp, 1 MB)</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/cs6ch3.pdf">Chapter 3 - Electrostatic Precipitators (pdf)</a><span class="fileinfo">&nbsp; (70 pp, 858 KB)</span></td></tr></tbody></table><h2><a class="ck-anchor" id="cost reports"></a>Cost Reports</h2><p>Cost reports provide details on the capital and annual costs of regulations that EPA prepares as well as the necessary information to determine how these costs are estimated. More information on how costs are estimated can be found by consulting the EPA Air Pollution Control Cost Manual (see above).</p><p>Below is a list of cost reports prepared by EPA. The cost reports are generally available in PDF format (unless otherwise noted) and can be downloaded by clicking on the links below.</p><table class="wide"><thead><tr><th colspan="2">Cost Reports</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><div><a href="/sites/production/files/2015-11/documents/assessment_of_non-egu_nox_emission_controls_and_appendices_a_b.pdf">Non-EGU Emissions Reductions Cost and Potential (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(192 pp, 4.4 MB)</span></div></td><td class="col">11/2015</td></tr><tr><td><div><a href="/sites/production/files/2020-07/documents/pechan8-11.pdf">NOX Emissions Control Costs for Stationary Reciprocating Internal Combustion Engines in the NOX SIP Call States (pdf)</a>&nbsp;<span class="fileinfo">(47 pp, 452 KB)</span></div></td><td>04/2000</td></tr></tbody></table>



  
  
  
  

